---

<Base title="Partial Hospitalization Program (PHP) in CT | Hopewell" description="Full-day, in-person PHP in Glastonbury, CT for adults who need more support than IOP, without an overnight stay. Check your coverage today." image={P + "php-group-room.webp"}>
  <Header />
  <main class="hw" data-pgx>
    <ServiceHero
      crumbs={[{ label: "Programs", href: "/programs/" }, { label: "PHP" }]}
      title="Partial Hospitalization Program (PHP) in Connecticut"
      lede="Full-day care at our Downtown Glastonbury office, 300 Hebron Ave, for adults who need more than IOP, without an overnight stay."
      bullets={heroUsps}
      facts={[{ icon: "star", text: "4.8 · 368 Google reviews" }, { icon: "clock", text: "Mon–Fri · 9 AM–3 PM" }]}
      image={P + "php-group-room.webp"}
    />
    <Creds />

    <Split heading="What is a Partial Hospitalization Program?" img={P + "php-group-room.webp"} alt="The PHP group room at our Downtown Glastonbury office" img2="/Assets/service/php-what-is.webp" alt2="Partial hospitalization day program in Glastonbury, CT">
      <p><strong>A higher level of care, without an overnight stay.</strong> Hopewell Health Solutions’ Partial Hospitalization Program (PHP) provides concierge, customized, comprehensive, structured treatment for several hours daily. It’s an ideal model for those needing more support than outpatient therapy, but not requiring inpatient hospitalization.</p>
      <p>PHP lets you live at home while receiving intensive <a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/group-therapy/">group therapy</a>, individual therapy, medication management, skill-building, and experiential wellness, including yoga, art therapy, sound healing, weight training, hiking, Reiki, needlework, and meditation.</p>
      <p>Want the full breakdown? Read our guide: <a class="inl" href="/post/what-is-a-partial-hospitalization-program-php/">What is a Partial Hospitalization Program (PHP)?</a></p>
    </Split>

    <Split heading="The benefits of PHP" img="/Assets/service/what-is-adhd.webp" alt="Adults in a group session at Hopewell's Glastonbury office" reverse tone="stone">
      <p><strong>A comprehensive approach.</strong> PHP is beneficial for:</p>
      <CheckList items={benefitsFor} />
      <p>This goal-oriented program focuses on <strong>stabilization, enhancing coping skills, and improving overall quality of life.</strong></p>
    </Split>

    <Prose startTone={0} blocks={[
      { id: "who-php-is-for", h2: "Who a Partial Hospitalization Program Is For",
        paras: [
          "A partial hospitalization program is for adults whose symptoms are making it hard to get through the day, when weekly therapy or an <a class='inl' href='/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/'>intensive outpatient program</a> hasn’t been enough, or when they’re stepping down from a hospital stay, detox or residential treatment and need daily structure to keep steady. You get full days of treatment, then sleep at home each night.",
          "Referring clinicians often recommend PHP <a class='inl' href='/post/why-the-er-is-not-mental-health-treatment-and-why-php-and-iop-is/'>after a crisis</a>, when someone is safe enough to be at home but needs more than a few hours of care a week. Families look for it when a loved one is struggling to work, eat, sleep or function, and outpatient care isn’t holding. Our <a class='inl' href='/admissions/'>admissions team</a> can talk through whether PHP, IOP or another level fits.",
          "PHP is not emergency or 24-hour care. If you or someone you love is in immediate danger, call or text <a class='inl' href='tel:988'>988</a>, call 911, or go to the nearest emergency room.",
        ],
        aside: { type: "points", title: "PHP is often a fit when…", items: [["alert", "Symptoms make daily life hard to manage"], ["refresh", "IOP or weekly therapy hasn’t been enough"], ["home", "You’re stepping down from a hospital stay or rehab"], ["shield", "You’re safe at home but need daily structure"]] } },
      { id: "php-depression-anxiety", h2: "PHP for Depression and Anxiety in Glastonbury, CT",
        paras: [
          "Depression and anxiety are among the most common reasons adults join our partial hospitalization program in Glastonbury. When low mood, panic, constant worry or exhaustion take over, a full day of structure, groups, individual therapy and psychiatric care in one place, can help you stabilize faster than a weekly appointment allows.",
          "Your day blends DBT and CBT skills groups, process groups and creative or holistic groups, with one-on-one sessions and psychiatric evaluation built in. Psychiatric providers manage medication alongside therapy, and <a class='inl' href='/treatment-methods/genesight-testing/'>GeneSight® testing</a> can help guide medication choices. Learn more about <a class='inl' href='/what-we-treat/depression/'>depression treatment</a> and <a class='inl' href='/what-we-treat/anxiety/'>anxiety treatment</a>.",
          "PHP also treats trauma, <a class='inl' href='/what-we-treat/bipolar/'>bipolar and other mood disorders</a>, and mental health alongside substance use, with <a class='inl' href='/treatment-methods/medication-assisted-treatment/'>medication-assisted treatment (MAT)</a> available when it fits your plan.",
        ],
        aside: { type: "img", src: P + "php-group-room.webp", alt: "The partial hospitalization program group room at 300 Hebron Ave in Glastonbury, CT", cap: "PHP group room, 300 Hebron Ave" } },
      { id: "after-php", h2: "After PHP: Stepping Down to IOP",
        paras: [
          "PHP is designed to be a bridge, not a destination. As symptoms settle, your care team plans a step-down to an <a class='inl' href='/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/'>IOP</a>, which meets about three hours a day, four days a week, so you can start returning to work, school and family routines with support still in place.",
          "Because PHP, IOP, counseling and medication management are all run by the same Connecticut team, nothing restarts when you step down. Your therapist, prescriber and treatment plan carry forward. You can compare every level of care on our <a class='inl' href='/programs/'>programs page</a>, or see the <a class='inl' href='/location/glastonbury-ct-2/'>Downtown Glastonbury office</a> where PHP meets.",
        ],
        aside: { type: "table", title: "PHP vs. IOP", head: ["", "PHP", "IOP"], rows: [["Hours", "About 6 a day", "About 3 a day"], ["Days", "Mon–Fri", "Mon–Thu"], ["Best for", "Daily structure, stabilizing", "Building skills around work or school"], ["Where", "300 Hebron Ave", "300 Hebron Ave, 1420 Main St & Westbrook"], ["Next step", "IOP", "Counseling & medication management"]] } },
    ]} />

    <IconCards heading="A multimodal treatment approach" lede="Specialized treatment &amp; interventions. Hopewell Health Solutions’ PHP offers <strong>6 structured hours of treatment daily, Monday through Friday.</strong> Through evidence-based modalities, individualized plans, and specialized interventions, our PHP stabilizes symptoms of substance use and co-occurring disorders, while promoting successful community reintegration and long-term recovery. A unique feature: a customizable approach that lets you build a tailored schedule for the group component of PHP." items={approach} cols={2} />

    <section class="section is-mist" id="schedule">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>A day in PHP</h2><p class="lede"><strong>The structure is the medicine.</strong> Monday–Friday · held at our Downtown Glastonbury office, 300 Hebron Ave, with therapy and medication management at our offices in <a class="inl" href="/location/west-hartford-ct/">West Hartford</a>, <a class="inl" href="/location/east-hampton-ct/">East Hampton</a> &amp; <a class="inl" href="/location/westbrook-ct/">Westbrook</a>.</p></div>
        <ol class="pg-day" style="--n:7">
          {phpDay.map(([time, act]) => <li><strong>{time}</strong><h3>{act}</h3></li>)}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section is-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>PHP vs. IOP, what’s the difference?</h2><p class="lede"><strong>Find the right starting point.</strong> The difference comes down to intensity. Many clients step down from PHP into our <a class="inl" href="/programs/adult-mental-health-iop/">Adult Mental Health IOP</a> as they stabilize, Hopewell Health Solutions helps you find the right level.</p></div>
        <div class="levels-grid pg-vs">
          <Schedule title="PHP" stat="6 h" note="a day · Monday through Friday" days={[6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 0, 0]} tone={3} icon="calendar">
            <p>About <strong>six hours a day, Monday through Friday</strong>the highest level of outpatient care. Best for stabilizing after a crisis or stepping down from inpatient.</p>
          </Schedule>
          <Schedule title="IOP" stat="3 h" note="a day · four days a week" days={[3, 3, 3, 3, 0, 0, 0]} tone={2} icon="refresh">
            <p>About <strong>three hours a day, four days a week</strong>lighter structure so you can keep working, studying, or caring for family. See our <a class="inl" href="/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/">IOP programs</a>.</p>
          </Schedule>
        </div>
        <p class="levels-key"><span class="key-swatch"></span>Hours of care each day in a typical week</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Split heading="Who our PHP is designed for" img={P + "iop-group-room-lights.webp"} alt="A Hopewell group room for partial hospitalization" tone="stone">
      <p><strong>Support tailored to you.</strong></p>
      <CheckList items={whoFor} />
      <div class="pg-panel">
        <h3>Addiction PHP</h3>
        <p>Our addiction PHP treats alcohol, drug, and prescription drug addiction in Glastonbury, with SUD groups, MAT when it fits your plan, and care for <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/co-occurring/">co-occurring conditions</a>. It is a common step-down after inpatient rehab or detox, and as you stabilize you move into our <a class="inl" href="/programs/addiction-iop/">Addiction and Substance Use IOP</a> in Glastonbury or Westbrook.</p>
      </div>
    </Split>

    <IconCards heading="Additional wellness &amp; support services" lede="Everything in one place." items={services} />

    <Quote text="“A safe place to heal and rebuild.”" cite="Our PHP is a concierge wellness service customized to you, a targeted program that propels you toward health, on your terms." img={P + "group-room-bright.webp"} />

    <IconCards heading="Why people choose Hopewell for PHP" lede="Why families choose Hopewell." items={unique} tone="stone" />

    <ModalitiesOutcomes mHeading="Modalities used in our PHP" modalities={modalities} outcomes={outcomes} note="Plus Reiki, hiking, weight training, needlework &amp; other holistic options, and <a class='inl' href='/programs/medication-management/'>medication management</a>." tone="white" />

    <VideoCarousel videos={stories} heading="Stories of Hope, in Their Own Words" lede="Clients share what intensive treatment was like. Hear more on the <a class='inl' href='/podcast/'>Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast</a>." />

    <NewsVideos heading="See Hopewell Health Solutions" lede="In the room &amp; in the news." videos={interviews} />

    <Team heading="Your PHP Care Team" lede="Clinicians, psychiatric providers, and experiential therapists who work as one team. <a class='inl' href='/about-us/team/'>Meet our full team</a>." slugs={["teesha-huertas-lcsw", "tracy-sibley-pmhnp-bc-aprn", "katherine-salvador-pa-c", "chris-patenaude-pa", "chelsey-micciche-lpc", "sherrie-gaudet-lcsw", "kelvin-young-cpsrp"]} tone="white" />

    <Insurance heading="Comprehensive coverage options" lede="We accept most major PPO plans. If you have specific questions about your coverage, contact us, our team verifies your benefits at no cost, before you commit to anything." />
    <Locations heading="Where PHP Meets" lede="PHP is held at our <a class='inl' href='/location/glastonbury-ct-2/'>Downtown Glastonbury office</a>, 300 Hebron Ave. Reach us at <a class='inl' href='tel:8607351448'>(860) 735-1448</a> · Fax (860) 781-8588 · <a class='inl' href='mailto:hhs4help@gmail.com'>hhs4help@gmail.com</a>." current="glastonbury-ct-2" />
    <Reviews tone="white" heading="What Our Clients Say" />
    <Faq faqs={faqs} heading="PHP, common questions" tone="stone" />

    <section class="section is-stone">
      <div class="container pg-cta-split">
        <div class="pg-cta-box">
          <span class="usp-icon"><Icon name="clipboard" class="h-6 w-6" /></span>
          <h3>What kind of treatment do I need?</h3>
          <p>Not sure which level of care fits? Take our quick, confidential screening and we’ll point you in the right direction.</p>
          <a href="/admissions/" class="btn btn-blue">Start the screening<Icon name="arrow" /></a>
        </div>
        <div class="pg-cta-box">
          <span class="usp-icon" style="background:#fff;color:var(--hw-blue)"><Icon name="link" class="h-6 w-6" /></span>
          <h3>Referring a client?</h3>
          <p>Clinicians and providers can refer to our PHP in minutes, download the referral form to get started.</p>
          <a href="/admissions/" class="btn btn-ghost">Start a referral<Icon name="arrow" /></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <OtherPrograms current="/programs/partial-hospitalization-program/" />
    <ClosingCta heading="Start your healing journey today" lede="Healing is possible, and you don’t have to do it alone. At Hopewell Health Solutions, we’re committed to walking alongside you with evidence-based tools, compassionate support, and space for real transformation. Now accepting new clients, we accept most major insurance plans and offer flexible payment options." image={P + "php-group-room.webp"} />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
